<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine airport sell-off may be by July - Menem.</title>
<headline>Argentine airport sell-off may be by July - Menem.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina may be ready to privatize its main airports by July, President Carlos Menem said Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;Maybe by July we will be ready to privatize 59 of our country's airports,&quot; Menem said, quoted by local news agencies.</p>
<p>Argentina's Congress has still to approve a bill to sell off the airports.</p>
<p>((-- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
